### ================================================================
### FASE 5 — Dashboard Académico (AIB-9)
### Prerequisito: fases 1, 2, 3 y 4 ejecutadas
###
### Estado de la BD al llegar aquí:
###   subjectId=1  "Cálculo Diferencial"  test-student-123  2025-1
###     cutId=5  Corte 1  30%  grade=5.00  ← (5.0*60)/60
###     cutId=6  Corte 2  30%  grade=3.50  ← 3.5*100/100
###     cutId=7  Corte 3  40%  grade=null
###
###   overallAverage  = (5.00*30 + 3.50*30) / 100 = 2.55
###   academicGpa     = 2.55  (única materia con al menos un corte calificado)
### ================================================================

@baseUrl = https://aibert-academic-service-qa.yellowwave-cb2d91fc.centralus.azurecontainerapps.io
@studentId = test-student-123


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 1 — Estudiante sin materias → 200 OK, lista vacía
# Usa un studentId diferente que nunca creó materias
# Espera:
#   { "success": true,
#     "data": { "studentId": "student-otro", "subjects": [] },
#     "message": "El estudiante no tiene materias registradas" }
# academicGpa omitido (null → @JsonInclude NON_NULL)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET summary para student-otro (sin materias)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/summary
studentId: student-otro


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 2 — Dashboard de test-student-123 → 200 OK
# Espera:
#   studentId = "test-student-123"
#   academicGpa = 2.55
#   subjects[0]:
#     subjectId = 1
#     subjectName = "Cálculo Diferencial"
#     semester = "2025-1"
#     overallAverage = 2.55
#     cuts[0]: id=5  cutName="Corte 1"  cutPercentage=30  grade=5.00
#     cuts[1]: id=6  cutName="Corte 2"  cutPercentage=30  grade=3.50
#     cuts[2]: id=7  cutName="Corte 3"  cutPercentage=40  grade=null (omitido)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET summary para test-student-123 (con materia y notas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/summary
studentId: {{studentId}}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 3 — Aislamiento: student-otro no ve materias de test-student-123 → 200 OK
# El resumen es personal: cada estudiante solo ve lo suyo
# Espera: misma respuesta vacía que CASO 1
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET summary aislamiento — student-otro
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/summary
studentId: student-otro


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CASO 4 — Dashboard con materia sin notas → overallAverage omitido
# Crear una materia nueva solo para este test (no afecta a subject id=1)
# Primero crear la materia, luego consultar el dashboard
# Espera en el dashboard:
#   subject 1: overallAverage=2.55  (con notas)
#   subject 3: overallAverage=null  (sin notas, campo omitido)
#   academicGpa=2.55 (solo cuenta subject 1)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### POST materia sin notas — subjectId=3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subjects
Content-Type: application/json
studentId: {{studentId}}

{
  "subjectName": "Estadística v3",
  "credits": 2,
  "teacherName": "Prof. Medina",
  "semester": "2025-1",
  "schedule": "JUEVES 10:00-12:00",
  "evaluationCuts": [
    { "cutName": "Corte 1", "cutPercentage": 50 },
    { "cutName": "Corte 2", "cutPercentage": 50 }
  ]
}


### GET summary con 2 materias (una sin notas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/academic/summary
studentId: {{studentId}}
